# Internal audit and phase records. Kept on disk because they are the working
# record of what was found, decided and deliberately left undone — and kept out
# of the repository because they are an unsparing internal assessment of this
# project, not documentation of how it works. `docs/` is the published, current
# description of the system; this directory is the notebook behind it.
